{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1bb354825223d9e48ca133f85c3d4f26caeb8ff6f1e865910fdef8af74d3edea", "ja": "（もうじき、風花の765プロ劇場の初公演だ。毎日\n遅くまでレッスンしてるけど、調子はどうだろう？）", "zh": "（风花在765艺能剧场的首次公演就快到了。\n她每天都练习到很晚，不知道状况如何？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "becaa9603804e8bfbf99e670557feae2f14d606a33524d6321d8accad7664413", "ja": "風花、お疲れさま！", "zh": "风花，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "02e64f5f278b1404c2239e07e7fac5d3df21960f56b33a61004da6393f99b7dd", "ja": "あっ……{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7548144e6ce07b6af0f4d48689d9f5de3d1563314815320c0cea6963cebb200c", "ja": "こんな時間に、どうしたんですか？\nライブ前で、忙しいって言ってたのに。", "zh": "这么晚了有什么事情吗？\n你不是说演唱会快到了，很忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "003eae648a69cc5ca9412f1111bc2de822dd320de8174c6aa51cba4fb30af7c0", "ja": "ちょっと、風花の様子が気になって……\n今、大丈夫か？", "zh": "因为我有点在意风花的情形如何……\n现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "39124f32f83dfe460fe0ccb63b31b9afcf2e554e07308b819af4af9ff5a5101c", "ja": "はい、ちょうど休憩に入ったところです。\nあ、お茶でもどうぞ。今、持ってきますね。", "zh": "没关系的，其实我正好要休息。\n啊，请喝茶吧。我现在去拿哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "af9c5392195ccdbf113aa8caa47f0edfa74f36ace008fc00a5ff2b86cac7fdc8", "ja": "（レッスンの後で疲れてるだろうに……\nでも、この気遣いは流石だな）", "zh": "（她才刚练习完，应该很累才对……\n不过，她的细心真令人佩服。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "da86af9d3d322402c9d2d36b42db72b7fa46d862fac3acfc464f4e09dfbfab07", "ja": "お待たせしました。\nはい、お茶をどうぞ♪", "zh": "久等了。\n来，请喝茶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cc22256619c054899f59e4c08bfb1bed6b2da5c602e3e1e232eebd351a963896", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。\nいただきます。", "zh": "好，谢谢。\n我就不客气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "34c7c3b227c956e16947be1be5a16ed93a6085d949194317d2338d89bb52baec", "ja": "私の様子、見に来てくれたんですか？\nふふっ、嬉しいな♪", "zh": "你刚刚说要来看我的情形是吗？\n呵呵，我好开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e02f0bdc8558891cd0ebaffd9e9a988df88da2fa709d301814d3101208d24632", "ja": "大事なアイドルのことだからな。\nそれで、レッスンは？　順調か？", "zh": "因为你是很宝贵的偶像啊。\n所以，练习得如何？还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "002795108603be6c5b9eb22921424c1dd63e6379ff5fe29998b4fbc22eaf7276", "ja": "はい、順調です！　歌もダンスも、\nなんとか覚えられたと思います。", "zh": "是，非常顺利！\n我总算是把歌曲和舞步都记起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f4f2746f511d8de1d8c6cb93809c59006c8a9119bfbb962b10f23ef1f63a4fa1", "ja": "ただ……本番のことを考えると、\n正直、ちょっと怖くて……。", "zh": "只是……一想到要正式上场，\n说真的，我有点害怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "258bde34b056bf34de36d57cf28fea2aa0be792d1edd319361a9f3e6e0a23ae9", "ja": "風花……。", "zh": "风花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "459e472d043fdb27060c79cd330fe0c0a40a1dc3e62e2e1b7afa622c9903bbdb", "ja": "アイドルとして、初めてステージに立てる。\n本当なら、楽しみで仕方がないはずなんですけど。", "zh": "这是我当上偶像后第一次登上舞台。\n本来应该充满期待才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cf4b7c652a35c50bbbc28ef74306e3c26052691887530247f25ab9adfcd3e7bc", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n何か私に、アドバイスをもらえますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n可以请你给我一些建议吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "64f8927df8ac5d0666e5bafa32c0bbd0dadac7500e1150dd8d963c287e554e6e", "ja": "そうだな……。", "zh": "我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_1017", "source_sha256": "58930587cde1a666ab8f534f86e8c6ece375438bc6b88a0c05a301edf26f74a3", "ja": "普段どおりで", "zh": "像平常一样", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "832ac1cd9291db634f522c8288e7827e75eb95c2780c563cebafcab707596b15", "ja": "風花は自然に気を遣えるから、\nファンがしてほしいことも、自然と気づくと思う。", "zh": "风花，你总是自然而然地为别人着想，\n我想你到时应该也自然会发现粉丝想要什么吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_2001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d924c1cc3c3fadfcd2afc4dfc2365be0ea317e451f23f3b43a4cb439aae8e8ea", "ja": "ええっ？\n私、そんなに気遣いが得意なほうじゃ……。", "zh": "咦？\n但我觉得自己没办法那么细心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "245aa2845f6affeb32e1432aa00f361510666357e8e984dc2d600c9cdcf73188", "ja": "そんなことないよ。俺にこうしてお茶を\n持ってきてくれたことだって、立派な気遣いだ。", "zh": "怎么会呢？像刚才拿茶过来给我喝，\n这就是很细心的举动啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_2003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "76e517fb836208cd38c98c3985f204f9275857f4f222fbf48f11e7a76603ce7c", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nあ、ありがとうございます……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n谢、谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_2004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6e56686705be28e9a36361a5df5e3bb3313209bc18e7d256d36a51e9c44ee567", "ja": "ふふっ。{$P$}さんのおかげで、\nなんだか元気が出てきました。", "zh": "呵呵，多亏{$P$}先生的鼓励，\n我感觉有点精神了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_2005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fa21e9798afd58254f8687b75bf5fbb53bf59206d44d705e71f34c56f684870d", "ja": "私……お客さん達に喜んでもらえるように、\nこの後のレッスンも頑張りますね！", "zh": "我……为了要让观众看得开心，\n之后也会继续努力练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_2006_p", "source_sha256": "35ca68c157d365fced06a317cdcd2a88d24bfd7e0eadcac488d068030331f669", "ja": "（お世辞だと思われたかな。\nでも本当に、これが風花の良さなんだ）", "zh": "（她似乎以为我在讲客套话。\n不过我说的确实就是风花的优点。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_2007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1df7362930d97f2403b8d15fe98f6adaa833993a73dcd92d8f823529b3148381", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん？　忙しいのは\nわかりますけど、ちゃんと休みを取ってくださいね。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生？\n我知道你这阵子很忙，但还是要好好休息哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_2008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cd5d7ee927e19bc3987eaebc209fda26b41fdc5bbe4219c3695b4297621d2b4f", "ja": "私、看護は得意ですけど……\n倒れられたりしたら、困っちゃいますからね？", "zh": "虽然我的专长是护理没错……\n但要是你真的累倒了，我会伤脑筋哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_003_2009_p", "source_sha256": "621608e4b065b41d2dae8676abe40c227e4aa227f8b80e8201a44f989136e941", "ja": "（いい笑顔だ……。公演の最後には、\nきっとまたこの笑顔が見られるだろう！）", "zh": "（好棒的笑容……在公演的最后，\n肯定能再度看到她展现这个笑容吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
